  "description": "Lightweight, zero-dependency fluent validation library for .NET 7/8/9.\n            Alternative to FluentValidation with async support, conditional rules (When/Unless),\n            cascade mode, nested object validation, collection validation (RuleForEach),\n            and seamless DI registration — all without external dependencies beyond\n            Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions.",
